er\",\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1571955,\"title\":\"Collision Course\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s2eAK0uiODjlNUSIiOBwdp3at2u.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uI3kWI7kGW5E0F8WduewgQYPt34.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Spain, 2013. After robbing a bank, a getaway crash reveals the hidden side of each thief, exposing betrayals and lies that began long before the heist.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2034,\"title\":\"Training Day\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bUeiwBQdupBLQthMCHKV7zv56uv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nuO8o9ltxhI7AZQxePavEZ4TyHa.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On his first day on the job as a narcotics officer, a rookie cop works with a rogue detective who isn't what he appears.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1236045,\"title\":\"Animals\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iISM36voS1E8gX9BM0DVK0kgi3E.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5yzM78Tp8nYwSCQtyRcmnHmCn5C.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When the son of an L.A. mayoral candidate is kidnapped, he and his wife have a few hours to come up with the ransom payment. With most of their money spent on his political campaign, they have to get their hands dirty and expose a side of their lives they never intended to see the light of day.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":475557,\"title\":\"Joker\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/udDclJoHjfjb8Ekgsd4FDteOkCU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rlay2M5QYvi6igbGcFjq8jxeusY.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During the 1980s, a failed stand-up comedian is driven insane and turns to a life of crime and chaos in Gotham City while becoming an infamous psychopathic crime figure.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Thriller\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":106646,\"title\":\"The Wolf of Wall Street\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kW9LmvYHAaS9iA0tHmZVq8hQYoq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7Nwnmyzrtd0FkcRyPqmdzTPppQa.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A New York stockbroker refuses to cooperate in a large securities fraud case involving corruption on Wall Street, corporate banking world and mob infiltration. Based on Jordan Belfort's autobiography.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1439930,\"title\":\"The Punisher: One Last Kill\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qQclTgLMDvGBuUBFGHRipxkEwWR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qO55CD8tgVL1T4WKn6zYFFiD6lL.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"As Frank Castle searches for meaning beyond revenge, an unexpected force pulls him back into the fight.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":272,\"title\":\"Batman Begins\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sPX89Td70IDDjVr85jdSBb4rWGr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9IIBboV7MCT0bTxzXHmWK1Hq558.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Driven by tragedy, billionaire Bruce Wayne dedicates his life to uncovering and defeating the corruption that plagues his home, Gotham City.  Unable to work within the system, he instead creates a new identity, a symbol of fear for the criminal underworld - The Batman.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Crime\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1422,\"title\":\"The Departed\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nT97ifVT2J1yMQmeq20Qblg61T.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6WRrGYalXXveItfpnipYdayFkQB.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"To take down South Boston's Irish Mafia, the police send in one of their own to infiltrate the underworld, not realizing the syndicate has done likewise. While an undercover cop curries favor with the mob kingpin, a career criminal rises through the police ranks. But both sides soon discover there's a mole among them.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11423,\"title\":\"Memories of Murder\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jcgUjx1QcupGzjntTVlnQ15lHqy.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6Kn6qW3an3DkPl3MahWemTzrjCt.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A sadistic serial rapist and murderer of young women terrorizes a small province in 1980s South Korea. To prevent further crimes, three increasingly desperate detectives with conflicting methods race against time to unravel the violent mind of the killer in a futile effort to solve the case.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"-4IUCT1tiys\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"tRQSgx2Iq_A\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"qzzFTAedk_Y\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}